WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.640
Caroline Aghajanian: On this
episode of "Travel Dares":

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.950
Aj Caldwell: I'm taking
Caroline to Battipaglia,

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.190
where we're gonna learn how to make

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.420
Italy's largest mozzarella ball.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.850
Caroline: And I'm taking
Aj on a water-bike tour

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:16.070
of the gorgeous Naples coastline.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.740
Come join us on our adventures

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.573
on this episode of "Travel Dares."

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.560
This is "Travel Dares."

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.820
The show where we do daring
activities all over Europe.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.170
And in this episode,
we're in Naples, Italy!

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.784
Aj, are you ready for your clue?

00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:37.320
Aj: Give me that clue!

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.150
Oh, I'm always ready
for some amazing views.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.445
Caroline: Great, but first,
you can't see anything.

00:00:44.445 --> 00:00:46.859
'Cause you're going in the blindfold.

00:00:46.859 --> 00:00:47.725
Aj: All right.

00:00:47.725 --> 00:00:49.430
So, when I think of amazing views,

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:53.600
I think of beautiful
beaches, beautiful buildings,

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.830
beautiful people.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.387
So maybe we're looking in a mirror?

00:00:56.387 --> 00:00:58.570
[both laughing]

00:00:58.570 --> 00:00:59.580
Caroline: Good one.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.800
The views in Naples are unlike
anywhere else in the world.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.330
And these water bikes
are a fun, active way

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.700
to explore the breathtaking coastline.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.790
Here, perfect.
Aj: All right.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.878
And your head is right there, great.

00:01:10.878 --> 00:01:13.490
OK, Aj, take your blindfold off.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:14.887
Aj: All right.
Caroline: Because we are

00:01:14.887 --> 00:01:16.661
biking through the water
on these hydro bikes!

00:01:16.661 --> 00:01:20.011
Aj: Oh, no way, this is so tight!

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.784
So, how do I get on this thing?

00:01:27.784 --> 00:01:29.494
Instructor: Get on your bike.

00:01:29.494 --> 00:01:32.844
[Aj laughs]
Caroline: Oh, wow!

00:01:32.844 --> 00:01:35.236
OK, whoo!

00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:36.740
Can I dip my feet in the water?

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.517
OK, I'm going, bye!
[Aj laughs]

00:01:39.517 --> 00:01:41.949
Oh, my God, all the fishies!

00:01:41.949 --> 00:01:43.849
Do you see them? They're so cute!

00:01:43.849 --> 00:01:44.957
They're like, mi, mi, mi, mi, mi,

00:01:44.957 --> 00:01:46.698
mi, mi, mi, mi, mi.
Aj: It's a school of fish.

00:01:46.698 --> 00:01:48.643
Oh, I can feel the waves coming in.

00:01:48.643 --> 00:01:51.460
Caroline: I think we're doing pretty well,

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.630
but I wanna race, I wanna
see if I can go faster

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.463
on the bike than you.

00:01:54.463 --> 00:01:56.160
Aj: Oh, you know I love winning.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.660
Caroline: You're about
to compete with someone

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.190
who takes cycling every week.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:00.480
Are you sure you can handle it?

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.063
Aj: Oh, I can handle it, Caroline.

00:02:02.063 --> 00:02:03.480
Caroline: OK, Aj, this is

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:06.677
your five stars on the line, are you sure?

00:02:06.677 --> 00:02:08.800
Aj: Oh, I will risk it all.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:12.240
Caroline: OK, Aj, three, two, one, go!

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.964
[Aj laughs]

00:02:13.964 --> 00:02:15.010
Whoo!
Aj: All right,

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.236
I'm coming for you Caroline!

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:18.604
Caroline: Oh, no, no, I'm
so much ahead! [laughs]

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:21.187
Aj: Oh, no, I'm coming up.
Caroline: Whoo!

00:02:22.312 --> 00:02:23.145
Aj: Why are you so good at this?

00:02:23.145 --> 00:02:25.890
Caroline: Yes, that's what I thought, Aj.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:27.673
Both Oh!

00:02:27.673 --> 00:02:30.170
Caroline: Whoo-hoo-hoo!
[Aj laughs]

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.003
Aj: Ah!

00:02:31.003 --> 00:02:32.469
Caroline: There goes your star!

00:02:32.469 --> 00:02:35.230
Aj: No, my five stars!

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:36.279
Caroline: I won.

00:02:36.279 --> 00:02:38.070
I finally beat Aj.
Aj: You earned it.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:38.910
Caroline: I did it.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:39.743
Aj: You paddled very hard.

00:02:39.743 --> 00:02:40.968
Caroline: But you did very well.

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.200
Aj: That was a lot of
fun. I enjoyed that race.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.360
Wow, I cannot believe this view!

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.700
Caroline: What a way to
enjoy this nice little town.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.750
Aj: Caroline, that was so much fun!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.411
Caroline: I know, I'm so
glad you had a good time.

00:02:54.411 --> 00:02:56.640
Aj: Oh, those bikes were so relaxing,

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.760
and the views were amazing.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.805
Caroline: So good.
Aj: But it's your turn.

00:03:00.805 --> 00:03:03.380
Are you ready for your clue?
Caroline: My clue!

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:04.215
OK.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.707
I think I know what this is!

00:03:09.707 --> 00:03:12.460
Oh, I'm sure you think
you know, but you don't.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.060
Caroline: We are gonna
be making pizza today

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.610
because Naples is so famous for pizza.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.293
Aj: If there's one thing
Italy's known for, it's food.

00:03:20.293 --> 00:03:22.950
Mozzarella was invented
here in the 12th century,

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.680
and we're gonna learn how to
make it the traditional way.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.705
Caroline: So many noises.
Aj: And you can step

00:03:26.705 --> 00:03:28.010
right here.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:29.700
Just take a bite of this.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.269
Caroline: What is it?
Aj: Just a small bite.

00:03:31.269 --> 00:03:32.102
Producer: Relax!

00:03:32.102 --> 00:03:34.060
Aj: Excellent, all right, now this way,

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.030
you can take your blindfold off

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.250
'cause we're gonna learn
how to make a mozzarella.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.778
Caroline: Oh, my God! That's huge!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.370
Aj: We're about to get an
exclusive, behind-the-scenes look

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.562
at how La Fattoria makes
their famous zizzona cheese.

00:04:24.129 --> 00:04:25.190
Aj: So, first they're gonna show us

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.290
how to braid it.
Caroline: OK.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:27.686
And then we're gonna give it a try.

00:04:27.686 --> 00:04:28.961
Caroline: We get to do that?

00:04:28.961 --> 00:04:30.127
Aj: We get to get hands-on.

00:04:30.127 --> 00:04:32.343
Caroline: Yes! Ooh!

00:04:32.343 --> 00:04:35.800
Ooh, it's hot! Ha, ha, ha! It's hot.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.880
Aj: Make it a big, long...
Caroline: Thing,

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.174
and then you fold like a pretzel.

00:04:40.174 --> 00:04:44.877
Oh, it's my baby cheese.
[Aj laughs]

00:04:44.877 --> 00:04:49.803
It's hot, whoo, I am born
to make mozzarella cheese.

00:04:51.902 --> 00:04:53.538
Wow.

00:04:53.538 --> 00:04:54.371
OK it's a pretzel, and then...

00:04:54.371 --> 00:04:57.150
Instructor: A pretzel, OK, then go in.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:01.980
Caroline: In. Oh, perfect,
I got it, I got it.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.242
Whoo!
[Aj laughs]

00:05:04.242 --> 00:05:07.350
Perfetto! Bellissimo!
Here, let me show you.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.410
You can hold my, what did you do?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.748
Aj: I did his steps up until

00:05:10.748 --> 00:05:12.165
I couldn't follow any more.
Caroline: No you didn't,

00:05:12.165 --> 00:05:13.542
this is not his steps.

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:15.430
This is Aj's.

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:19.720
We're gonna bring this one over here,

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.570
and then you're gonna twist this guy.

00:05:22.442 --> 00:05:26.348
Aj: I did it! [laughs]
Caroline: Whoo, Aj!

00:05:26.348 --> 00:05:28.910
Yay!
Aj: I did it!

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:29.968
Caroline: Oh, my God, I can't wait,

00:05:29.968 --> 00:05:30.984
when do we get to eat it?

00:05:30.984 --> 00:05:31.950
Aj: Right now.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.159
Caroline: Let's go. Oh, I'm so hungry.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.690
Yes, these are the ones we folded.

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.677
Aj: Yeah, because here's
your beautiful braid.

00:05:39.677 --> 00:05:40.510
Caroline: Of course.

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.290
Aj: And here's my not-so-beautiful braid.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:44.942
Caroline: Yes. Ooh, yes, OK.

00:05:44.942 --> 00:05:47.145
Aj: All right, I think I
got a little globby glob.

00:05:48.687 --> 00:05:50.510
Oho!
Caroline: Oh, my God.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:51.343
Aj: That is good.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.120
Caroline: This is like an
explosion. This is so good.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.771
I've had mozzarella cheese my whole life,

00:05:57.771 --> 00:05:59.323
but nothing compares to this.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.540
This cheese was so good, I can't wait

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.705
to take some back to the hotel.

00:06:04.705 --> 00:06:05.538
Cashier: Grazie.

00:06:05.538 --> 00:06:07.255
Caroline: Yay!
Aj: Grazie. Bye.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.320
Naples has been such a great time.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:18.420
There's so much to do here,
and there's so much to eat.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.790
Caroline, I need to know my rating.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.220
Caroline: So, you were so
relaxed on the water bikes,

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.110
and I think you really took the time

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.880
to really take in those views.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.080
But if you remember correctly,

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.830
you put your stars on the line

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.820
when we did our little race, and I won,

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:38.370
and for that I'm gonna have to
give you a four out of five.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.486
Aj: I expected that.

00:06:39.486 --> 00:06:41.852
You did do really well on those bikes.

00:06:41.852 --> 00:06:44.360
Caroline, as you know,
you haven't done too well

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.580
with the food dares.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:48.108
Your omelet was a little bit of a flop,

00:06:48.108 --> 00:06:50.583
but you braided the mozzarella perfectly.

00:06:50.583 --> 00:06:52.660
And you got it on your first try,

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:55.360
so for that I gotta give
you five out of five stars.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:58.683
Caroline: Whoo, that is right, yes!

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:03.016
Aj, I had such a blast traveling with you,

00:07:03.016 --> 00:07:06.000
and you nailed all of your
dares, so this is my treat.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.020
Aj: Oh, thanks!

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.360
Caroline: And I'm about
to go to Southern France

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.240
with my friend Nico!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.760
Aj: Well, I think I set
the bar pretty high,

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.220
so I'm curious to see if Nico can top it.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.320
Caroline: Well, I'm excited
for my next adventure.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.636
Aj: Cheers!
Caroline: Cheers!

